# `wrangler dev`'s build.command watcher rebuilds on any change under the
# project tree, and the build's own first step (npm run generate:summaries)
# writes into src/data/generated/ — without this, that write is itself seen
# as a change, restarting the build, which writes the same files again,
# forever. Doesn't affect `npm run build`/CI, which only run once.
src/data/generated/
